  "description": "A reusable, host-agnostic on-screen keyboard and a keyboard-aware split container. Pushes typed key events to whatever target a host wires up; never fills a focused text field and never risks opening a native keyboard.",
  "id": "Kazo.Os.AppSdk.VirtualKeyboard",
